<title>THAILAND: BOXING-WORAPHIN RETAINS IBF MINI-FLYWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-WORAPHIN RETAINS IBF MINI-FLYWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Rattanaphol S.Woraphin retained his International Boxing Federation (IBF ) mini-flyweight title when he outpointed Colombian challenger Juan Herrera in north-eastern Nakhon Ratchasima province on Saturday.</p>
<p>The judges scored unanimously in Woraphin's favour -- 115-113, 116-111 and 117-109.</p>
